            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Gaius Marius</strong><br>\nGaius Marius was born in 157 BCE in Arpinum, a town located in central Italy. Coming from a non-aristocratic background, his rise to power was not typical for Roman standards, which favored the patrician class. Despite this, he showed early signs of military talent and ambition. His family had enough standing to provide him with a decent education and the connections necessary to start a career in the military or public service.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Military Reforms</strong><br>\nMarius is best known for his military reforms, which he enacted during his consulships. Before him, the Roman army was composed primarily of land-owning citizens. Marius opened the army to the capite censi, or head count, allowing the poor to enlist. This change offered a stable career and social mobility for many Romans and resulted in a professional standing army loyal to their generals rather than the state.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Jugurthine War</strong><br>\nMarius rose to prominence through his command in the Jugurthine War against the North African King Jugurtha from 111 to 105 BCE. Marius claimed victory due to his innovative military tactics and the reorganization of the Roman legion. His success in this war was instrumental in gaining political popularity and served as a stepping stone to his multiple consulships.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
